Apple has again added a collection of classic movies to <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/apple-tv/">Apple TV</a> that subscribers can now stream at no extra cost.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2025/10/Apple-TV-Color.jpg" alt="" width="1600" height="900" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1023382" /><br/>
